text:
"Javid Shah" echoes through the streets across Iran, and it is time for European leaders to listen.

I hereby call on 
@eucopresident
, 
@EP_President
, and 
@kajakallas
 to listen to the Iranian people and meet with the leader of the Iranian opposition, 
@PahlaviReza
.

